rnqnx: Tile label "学習ノート" (expo.name) is 5.4 px too wide for the Marathon launcher: it measures 95.8 px in Source Sans 3 Regular / Source Sans 3 Light at 20 px, and the label box is 92.4 px wide on one line with 2 px kept free. Set expo.extra.rnqnx.shortName to a shorter label. expo.name stays the window title.
